<title>USA: Brown Group Inc Q3 Nov 2 net up.</title>
<headline>Brown Group Inc Q3 Nov 2 net up.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS, Mo. 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.73		    $0.55</p>
<p> Net			 12,905		    9,715</p>
<p> Revs		     420,347		  406,921</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,702		   17,584</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Results for 1995 include unspecified costs for factory closings and associated LIFO inventory credits. Q3 1995 results included an after-tax LIFO credit of $3,218,000 or $0.18 a share.  </p>
<p>		     NINE MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	profit	  $1.07     loss	 $0.17</p>
<p> Net	profit	 18,946     loss	 3,077</p>
<p> Revs		   1,166,115		1,107,224</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  17,651		   17,590</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Nine-month 1995 results included a net charge of $4,012,000 or $0.23/share factory closing charge.</p>
<p>Nine-month 1996 results include LIFO credit of $2,500,000 or $0.14/share.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787</p>
